WEBVTT

00:05:27.073 --> 00:05:32.036
So amidst all that, I look at the support
from the different people.

00:05:32.078 --> 00:05:34.705
MR: And you take steps to make sure

00:05:34.747 --> 00:05:39.168
that your own self-care is,
you know, going well,

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.796
that you've got a balance
in what you're doing.

00:05:41.837 --> 00:05:43.214
VN: Yes.

00:05:43.255 --> 00:05:44.423
MR: What do you do?

00:05:44.465 --> 00:05:46.300
VN: Apart from the activism,

00:05:46.342 --> 00:05:49.261
I do many other things
in my own personal life.

00:05:50.221 --> 00:05:53.265
One, like you've talked about, self-care,
I really love to rest.

00:05:53.265 --> 00:05:55.810
And many times for me,
rest is actual sleep.

00:05:55.851 --> 00:05:57.353
(Laughter)

00:05:57.395 --> 00:06:00.940
Yes, so I really love to get good sleep.